Question: Determine whether the following two code snippets are semantic code clones.

Code 1: Python
```python
n = int(input())
A = list(map(int, input().split()))
for i in range(len(A)):
    m = i
    for j in range(i, len(A)):
        if A[j] < A[m]:
            m = j
    A[i], A[m] = A[m], A[i]
